{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-26","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：素数与互素与整数","englishTitle":"If two numbers be prime to two numbers, both to each, their products also will be prime to one another.","book":7,"number":26,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.26","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.26/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":26,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-26@raw-1e3bb6e939415f59","contentId":"euclid-7-26","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1e3bb6e939415f5927867107e40b22b48087bc1ec4bfd8b1803531c275d082fa","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-26.statement","euclid-7-26.construction.1","euclid-7-26.proof.1","euclid-7-26.proof.2","euclid-7-26.proof.3","euclid-7-26.proof.4","euclid-7-26.proof.5","euclid-7-26.proof.6","euclid-7-26.conclusion","euclid-7-26.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-26.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-26","revisionId":"euclid-7-26@raw-1e3bb6e939415f59","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"edf07aa0f9379ba394e5febbd54e814669b42f1c3643d6edd3e4469919154d44","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two numbers be prime to two numbers, both to each, their products also will be prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个数字是两个数字的正数, 每一个数字, 它们的产品也将是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-26.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-26","revisionId":"euclid-7-26@raw-1e3bb6e939415f59","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c721e008383e4b1bcf6a0cf8ace24918074370eacf10cfbbf0304d6db6b84dea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two numbers A, B be prime to the two numbers C, D; both to each, and let A by multiplying B make E, and let C by multiplying D make F; I say that E, F are prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B这两个数字要与这两个数字C,D相提并论;两者都相同,A和B的产物E,C和D的产物F;我说E,F是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-26.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-26","revisionId":"euclid-7-26@raw-1e3bb6e939415f59","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"758eee80ba2223ac957bdb578902df2ccd3bdd86f9b278c5b614167faea75a14","citations":["euclid-7-24"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since each of the numbers A, B is prime to C, therefore the product of A, B will also be prime to C. [[VII. 24](/principles/euclid-7-24)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A中,每个B都达到C,因此A产品,B产品也将达到C。 [[VII. 24](/principles/euclid-7-24)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-26.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-26","revisionId":"euclid-7-26@raw-1e3bb6e939415f59","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"58c6ef94d331cc7a72ed40f3f77d19aa03aaa7882b164abf0f179fd22309501e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the product of A, B is E; therefore E, C are prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A,B的产物是E,E,C是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-26.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-26","revisionId":"euclid-7-26@raw-1e3bb6e939415f59","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c2d81d595efa40891a3270d0af5f8c8df29e5988f9073244b4f2333887e49552","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason E, D are also prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,E,D也是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-26.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-26","revisionId":"euclid-7-26@raw-1e3bb6e939415f59","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bfe6781390a41083d5e079f803a36ea2ce7c0653cb98599db104c55a3ee52def","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore each of the numbers C, D is prime to E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C,D的每一个数字都是E的原始数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-26.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-26","revisionId":"euclid-7-26@raw-1e3bb6e939415f59","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7361e156b6e4e3aa13c866fe5f093e803339c5a7dc79990d6f01ca0d3295bb17","citations":["euclid-7-24"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the product of C, D will also be prime to E. [[VII. 24](/principles/euclid-7-24)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C,D的产物也将是E的原始产品。 [[VII. 24](/principles/euclid-7-24)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-26.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-26","revisionId":"euclid-7-26@raw-1e3bb6e939415f59","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d970edc4ba16a662aa3a88622ebe80f5360e3c6950027adc0467df7131f874ad","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the product of C, D is F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但C,D的产物是F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-26.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-26","revisionId":"euclid-7-26@raw-1e3bb6e939415f59","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"745d7b43671b866852c08303ba8a9379f7c18dcf68b3294c05214e8f2b2442b3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore E, F are prime to one another. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,E,F是互素。 Q,E。 D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-26.source","contentId":"euclid-7-26","revisionId":"euclid-7-26@raw-1e3bb6e939415f59","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ccea677bd4924d198631964f7466017cbe6236a1773cc5bf0a62f055a2b9bb96","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.26/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.26\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-26:euclid-7-24:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-26","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-26.proof.1","euclid-7-26.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-24","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.26","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.26/","sourceLabel":"VII. 24"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-27:euclid-7-26:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-27","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-27.proof.4"